    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:0.000000",
      "translatedText": "비가 와서 땅이 우물졌다",
      "text": "The rain formed small hollows in the <b>ground</b>. or The rain formed a pool in the <b>ground</b>."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:0.000000",
      "translatedText": "너쯤 거꾸러뜨리기는 쉬운 일이야",
      "text": "It's a cinch to get you down. or It's an easy job to throw you to the <b>ground</b>."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:0.000000",
      "translatedText": "눈이 지면에 쌓여 있었다.",
      "text": "Snow lay on the <b>ground</b>."
